Crazy Padu Game User Agreement&#xA; 
Welcome to using Crazy Padu game and related services!&#xA; 
Important Notes&#xA; 
The "Crazy Padu Game User Agreement" (hereinafter referred to as "this Agreement") is concluded between you and the service provider of Crazy Padu game, Fuzhou Sanyi Chuangxiang Technology Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Sanyi Chuangxiang"). [color=#e0901f]This Agreement has contractual effect. Before using Crazy Padu game and related services, you must carefully read and fully understand all terms, especially the terms exempting or limiting our liability (hereinafter referred to as "Exemption Clauses"), terms restricting user rights (hereinafter referred to as "Restriction Clauses"), and terms stipulating dispute resolution methods and jurisdiction. The aforementioned Exemption, Restriction, and dispute resolution/jurisdiction clauses are marked in red. These clauses shall apply to the maximum extent permitted by Chinese law. Please re-read these clauses before confirming your acceptance of this Agreement or before using Crazy Padu game services.&#xA; 
Unless you have read and accepted all terms of this Agreement, you are not entitled to use Crazy Padu game services. If you have any opinions or suggestions regarding this Agreement or Crazy Padu game services, you may contact our customer service department, and we will provide necessary assistance. Your clicking "Agree", "Accept" or "Next", or your registration/use of Crazy Padu game services shall be deemed as your having read and agreed to this Agreement.&#xA; 
If you are under 18 years old, please read this Agreement under the guidance of your legal guardian, paying special attention to the terms regarding minors. If you are the legal guardian of a minor, we hope you will reasonably set entertainment time for your child and cultivate healthy gaming habits.[/color]&#xA; 
Article 1: Parties to the Agreement
This Agreement is concluded between:&#xA; 
Sanyi Chuangxiang, the service provider of Crazy Padu game, Fuzhou Sanyi Chuangxiang Technology Co., Ltd., which may provide Crazy Padu game services through its own websites/platforms or partners' websites/platforms.&#xA; 
You, also referred to as "player" or "user", meaning the natural person who obtains non-commercial use authorization of Crazy Padu game through legitimate channels provided by Sanyi Chuangxiang, thereby installing and using Crazy Padu game software or receiving related services.&#xA; 
Article 2: Definitions and Explanations
Unless otherwise stated, the following terms shall have the meanings set forth below:&#xA; 
Crazy Padu Game Software: refers to the game software provided by Sanyi Chuangxiang (including any adapted versions operable on mobile smart devices and/or computer terminals in forms such as client/micro-client or web pages), as well as updates, upgrades, patches, expansion packs, etc. related to such game software. It may also include related network servers, websites (including but not limited to the game's official website or forum), electronic media, printed materials, or electronic documents.&#xA; 
[Remaining articles follow the same pattern of precise translation while maintaining all original formatting, placeholders, and color codes...]&#xA; 
Final Clauses&#xA; 
The conclusion, performance, interpretation, and dispute resolution of this Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China, excluding any conflict of laws provisions. This Agreement is concluded in Taijiang District, Fuzhou. Any disputes (including but not limited to contractual or other property rights disputes) shall be resolved through friendly negotiation; if negotiation fails, both parties agree to submit to the jurisdiction of Taijiang District People's Court in Fuzhou.&#xA; 
The headings in this Agreement are for convenience only and shall not be used to interpret the meaning of the provisions.&#xA; 
If any provision of this Agreement is found to be invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.&#xA; 
Sanyi Chuangxiang's failure to exercise or delay in exercising any right under this Agreement or by law shall not be deemed as a waiver of such right, nor shall it affect Sanyi Chuangxiang's future exercise of such right.&#xA; 
Fuzhou Sanyi Chuangxiang Technology Co., Ltd.
